[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Single-Source-of-Truth Ground Data System and I&T Platform

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-GDS-001
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Manifest-Synchronized Ground Command and Telemetry Dictionary Loader
STATEMENT: >>>
The ground control platform (StrataGround) shall load mission commands, telemetry channels, engineering-unit calibration curves, red/yellow limit thresholds, and partition/slot inventories directly from strata-gen mission_dict.json and enforce MANIFEST_HASH lock-step synchronization with the flight build.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Consuming the exact manifest-generated ground dictionary eliminates manual command/telemetry database drift during FlatSat, TVAC, and flight operations.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: ground/strata_ground/dictionary.py
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-GDS-002
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Real-Time Red/Yellow Telemetry Limit Monitoring with Persistence
STATEMENT: >>>
The ground control platform shall continuously evaluate calibrated engineering telemetry against lower/upper warning (Yellow) and error (Red) bounds with configurable persistence debouncing and structured alert callbacks.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Persistence-debounced Red/Yellow limit monitoring prevents transient single-sample glitches from flooding operator consoles while catching genuine thermal, power, and health anomalies immediately.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: ground/strata_ground/limits.py
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-GDS-003
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Flight Sequence (.seq) and Parameter Table (ParamBank) Compilers
STATEMENT: >>>
The ground control platform shall provide round-trip compilers and decompilers translating human-readable relative/absolute flight command sequences and parameter tables into MANIFEST_HASH-stamped, CRC-32C-verified binary flight images alongside CCSDS TC, ECSS-E-ST-70-41C (PUS-C), EventRecord, and NvLogRecord codecs.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Deterministic compile/decompile verification before uplink prevents syntax errors, mismatched opcodes, or stale schema hashes from reaching flight software.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: ground/strata_ground/cmd_seq_table.py
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-GDS-004
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Pluggable Stream Broker, PCAP Archival, CSV Export, and I&T Test Scripting API
STATEMENT: >>>
The ground control platform shall provide a pluggable telemetry/command stream broker with UDP/SIL ingress, modular packet handlers, standard Wireshark-compatible PCAP binary capture/replay, CSV export, and a Python GroundTestSession automation API supporting send_cmd, send_pus_tc, wait_for_tlm, wait_for_evr, wait_for_pus_tm, and assert_limits_nominal.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Scriptable I&T test procedures combined with lossless PCAP archival allow identical test suites to run unattended across host SIL, Verilator HIL, FlatSat, and TVAC campaigns.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: ground/strata_ground/stream_server.py
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-GDS-005
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Zero-Dependency Live Mission Control Web Console and REST API
STATEMENT: >>>
The ground control platform shall provide a self-contained browser-based Mission Control web console and JSON REST API exposing live calibrated telemetry and limit badges, interactive CCSDS TC and PUS-C command uplink, flight sequence compilation, command history, and live event streams without requiring external web frameworks or build toolchains.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A zero-dependency browser console deploys immediately on air-gapped cleanroom FlatSat and mission operations workstations.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: ground/strata_ground/web_console.py
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-008

[[/SECTION]]
